(Tarandeep Singh Juneja - Infrastructure / SRE Intern Assignment) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (GitHub Repository: https://github.com/tsj2003/Incident-Command) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Project: Mission-Critical Incident Management System \(IMS\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Summary) Tj
T* (This submission implements a resilient Incident Management System for high-volume) Tj
T* (distributed-stack signals across APIs, MCP hosts, caches, queues, RDBMS, and NoSQL stores.) Tj
T* (The system ingests signals asynchronously, applies API-key security and rate limiting,) Tj
T* (debounces noisy component failures, persists raw and structured data separately, exposes) Tj
T* (operational metrics, and provides a workflow-driven React dashboard with mandatory RCA) Tj
T* (before closure.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (How to run) Tj
T* (1. IMS_API_KEY=dev-secret docker compose -f docker-compose.production.yml up --build) Tj
T* (2. Open http://localhost:5173 for the dashboard.) Tj
T* (3. Open http://localhost:8000/health for health.) Tj
T* (4. Open http://localhost:9090/query for Prometheus.) Tj
T* (5. Seed data: cd backend && python3 scripts/simulate_failure.py --base-url) Tj
T* (http://localhost:8000 --api-key dev-secret --rate 1000 --duration 1 --batch-size 500) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Rubric coverage) Tj
T* (- Concurrency and scaling: FastAPI, asyncio workers, bounded queue of 25,000, batch flushing) Tj
T* (at 1,000 signals or 1 second, immediate 503 backpressure.) Tj
T* (- Data handling: JSONL raw signal audit log, SQLite source of truth, Redis-backed production) Tj
T* (hot cache and aggregation profile, in-memory local fallback.) Tj
T* (- LLD: Alerting Strategy pattern and Workflow State pattern.) Tj
T* (- UI/UX: React/Vite dashboard with live feed, detail view, raw signals, status workflow, RCA) Tj
T* (form, and audit timeline.) Tj
T* (- Resilience: exponential retry decorator for SQLite writes, graceful shutdown drain, health) Tj
T* (checks, Prometheus metrics, signal sanitization.) Tj
T* (- Testing: pytest suite covers alerting, RCA validation, batch processing, backpressure,) Tj
T* (sanitization, security, and health/metrics.) Tj
T* (- Documentation: README, benchmark report, production upgrade path, rubric mapping,) Tj
T* (screenshots guide, prompt/context/plan markdowns.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (MTTR formula) Tj
T* (MTTR = sum\(Resolution Timestamp - Incident Start Timestamp\) / Total Incidents Resolved) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Verification) Tj
T* (Backend tests: 13 passed. Frontend production build: successful.) Tj
